WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.492 --> 00:00:16.800
The Tang and Wujing were tied up inside the demons' cave.

2
00:00:17.921 --> 00:00:22.083
Bajie was also tied up, floating in the tub of salt water again.

3
00:00:23.244 --> 00:00:25.345
The three demons talked in another room.

4
00:00:25.365 --> 00:00:30.568
"That pig will taste wonderful once he's pickled," said the elephant.

5
00:00:32.148 --> 00:00:33.809
agree," said the lion.

6
00:00:33.829 --> 00:00:36.411
"But the main course is the Tang Monk.

7
00:00:37.292 --> 00:00:39.213
It will be nice to live forever."

8
00:00:40.894 --> 00:00:41.635
elephant nodded.

9
00:00:41.655 --> 00:00:44.517
"Let's fry the monk with garlic and spices.

10
00:00:45.417 --> 00:00:46.978
I'll go see what we have in the kitchen."

11
00:00:48.459 --> 00:00:49.800
a minute," said the raptor.

12
00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:52.042
"We need a plan.

13
00:00:52.782 --> 00:00:55.824
Wukong will certainly try to rescue his friends."

14
00:00:57.185 --> 00:00:58.606
right," said the lion.

15
00:00:59.267 --> 00:01:01.880
He felt his broken tooth.

16
00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:03.441
"I don't want that to happen."

17
00:01:05.021 --> 00:01:06.822
elephant looked at his bruised trunk.

18
00:01:06.842 --> 00:01:08.203
"Me neither."

19
00:01:09.643 --> 00:01:12.284
this time I have a plan," said the raptor.

20
00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:14.445
"We'll start a rumor.

21
00:01:15.226 --> 00:01:20.048
We'll tell every demon nearby that we've already eaten the Tang Monk.

22
00:01:20.848 --> 00:01:24.850
When Wukong hears that, he'll give up hope and leave the area."

23
00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:27.891
"Brilliant!" said the lion.

24
00:01:28.811 --> 00:01:29.852
elephant smiled.

25
00:01:30.196 --> 00:01:32.037
"It's the perfect plan."

26
00:01:34.959 --> 00:01:38.300
Wukong sat next to the road, thinking about what to do.

27
00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:43.163
"Those demons keep tricking me," the monkey said to himself.

28
00:01:44.624 --> 00:01:45.344
no more!

29
00:01:45.965 --> 00:01:48.046
I'll go into that cave and rescue my friends.

30
00:01:48.966 --> 00:01:52.168
When the demons attack, I'll clobber them with my iron bar.

31
00:01:54.049 --> 00:01:57.631
Even if they cry and promise not to hurt us, I won't believe them."

32
00:01:58.611 --> 00:01:59.452
monkey stood up.

33
00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:02.782
He saw two fiends coming down the road.

34
00:02:02.842 --> 00:02:06.184
"I wonder who they are," thought the monkey.

35
00:02:07.986 --> 00:02:11.528
He hid behind a rock and waited for the fiends to pass by.

36
00:02:11.548 --> 00:02:16.372
"Those demons are lucky," said one fiend.

37
00:02:16.392 --> 00:02:18.593
"Yep," said the other.

38
00:02:18.613 --> 00:02:25.178
"They ate the Tang Monk, and now they'll live forever," said the first fiend.

39
00:02:26.319 --> 00:02:30.433
sighed. "It would be nice to live forever."

40
00:02:30.513 --> 00:02:33.575
"Yep," said the other fiend.

41
00:02:34.715 --> 00:02:37.257
The two fiends continued along the road.

42
00:02:39.358 --> 00:02:40.238
was heartbroken.

43
00:02:40.878 --> 00:02:42.639
Tears poured from his eyes.

44
00:02:42.699 --> 00:02:44.880
"I failed you, Master!

45
00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:50.203
I couldn't protect you, and now you'll never reach the Western Paradise!"

46
00:02:52.736 --> 00:02:56.479
Wukong buried his head in his hands and cried for a long time.

47
00:03:01.323 --> 00:03:03.645
he stood up and wiped away the tears.

48
00:03:03.665 --> 00:03:07.108
"I know what I must do."

49
00:03:08.088 --> 00:03:10.730
The monkey leaped into the air and headed west.

50
00:03:14.634 --> 00:03:19.037
He arrived at the Thunderclap Monastery, and a guard let him enter.

51
00:03:20.338 --> 00:03:22.420
Wukong went before Buddha and bowed.

52
00:03:23.596 --> 00:03:25.997
"Forgive me, Buddha, but I have failed.

53
00:03:26.917 --> 00:03:36.422
Earlier today, the Tang Monk, he was he was The monkey burst into tears again.

54
00:03:38.282 --> 00:03:41.044
smiled. "Please don't cry, Wukong.

55
00:03:42.204 --> 00:03:43.865
Tang Monk is fine.

56
00:03:44.285 --> 00:03:46.046
The demons haven't eaten him."

57
00:03:47.666 --> 00:03:48.107
looked up.

58
00:03:48.127 --> 00:03:49.787
"Are you sure?"

59
00:03:50.047 --> 00:03:52.176
he asked hopefully.

60
00:03:52.997 --> 00:03:53.638
said Buddha.

61
00:03:53.658 --> 00:03:56.520
"I can see everything in the universe.

62
00:03:57.681 --> 00:04:01.164
I know exactly who those demons are and what they did.

63
00:04:02.326 --> 00:04:05.148
They tricked you into thinking they'd eaten the Tang Monk.

64
00:04:06.189 --> 00:04:07.971
They wanted you to give up hope."

65
00:04:07.991 --> 00:04:12.835
"What?" Wukong shouted in anger.

66
00:04:14.076 --> 00:04:15.037
rotten demons!

67
00:04:15.397 --> 00:04:21.552
They tricked me again!"

68
00:04:21.632 --> 00:04:24.293
Wukong swung his iron bar at the cave entrance.

69
00:04:26.594 --> 00:04:30.116
The entrance exploded, and the three demons ran outside.

70
00:04:31.336 --> 00:04:38.279
The lion demon shouted, "How dare you—" Suddenly he looked up and saw an enormous figure.

71
00:04:38.299 --> 00:04:43.202
"Buddha!" The lion and the elephant trembled with fear.

72
00:04:44.222 --> 00:04:48.324
Light flashed as Buddha turned the two demons into ordinary animals.

73
00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:52.081
Only the raptor demon wasn't scared.

74
00:04:53.122 --> 00:04:56.623
His eyes burning with fury, the bird shot toward Buddha.

75
00:04:57.483 --> 00:05:01.845
But Buddha raised a finger, and the bird was paralyzed in midair.

76
00:05:05.087 --> 00:05:06.067
looked at Wukong.

77
00:05:06.707 --> 00:05:08.728
"You may free your companions now.

78
00:05:10.249 --> 00:05:13.750
I will see you when you reach the Western Paradise."

79
00:05:16.111 --> 00:05:17.372
bowed. "Thank you,
